{
 "about": "Every statement ScannerRole can hold in deploy/scanner.yaml at fb9097a, before the Denies and opt-in Allows moved to managed policies (normalized by tests/cfn_templates.py: the conditions each comes under, sorted; action lists sorted). test_iam_limits.py holds the template to exactly these. A change to the role's permissions changes this file in the same pull request. Changed since fb9097a, deliberately: #94 (iam:PassedToService on the RDS export role also rds.amazonaws.com, which StartExportTask evaluates; kms:Decrypt also through logs.<region>, for log groups under a customer managed key); #105 (an optional allow-list of keys for every kms:Decrypt through a service, KmsAllowedKeyArns; timestream:Select and cassandra:Select under TimestreamRead and KeyspacesRead; the network interfaces Lambda places in the customer's VPC under VpcSubnetIds, as AWSLambdaVPCAccessExecutionRole grants them).",
